{"id":"b9b07b1eae12ec61","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-incompleteness-halting.md","title":"Incompleteness Equivalent to Halting","display":"prop-incompleteness-halting — Incompleteness Equivalent to Halting","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-incompleteness-halting","aliases":["92-prop-incompleteness-halting"],"display":"prop-incompleteness-halting — Incompleteness Equivalent to Halting","depends_on":["[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]","[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent]]","[[92-df-halting-set]]","[[92-df-godel-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-incompleteness-halting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-incompleteness-halting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-incompleteness-halting — Incompleteness Equivalent to Halting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02b34261c2cb199c\" href=\"?note=02b34261c2cb199c\" title=\"92-thm-first-incompleteness\">92-thm-first-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8665bbc504ca9fb6\" href=\"?note=8665bbc504ca9fb6\" title=\"92-thm-halting-undecidable\">92-thm-halting-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afb86879a743e8fe\" href=\"?note=afb86879a743e8fe\" title=\"92-thm-k-g-equivalent\">92-thm-k-g-equivalent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (halting set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span> (Gödel theorem-code set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\equiv_m K_G\">\\(K\\equiv_m K_G\\)</span> (mutual many-one reducibility)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}halting}\\vdash\nK\\equiv_m K_G\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}halting}\\vdash\nK\\equiv_m K_G\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>精确结论是停机集与定理码集在多一归约下具有相同可判定度</li>\n<li>从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>不可判定到句法不完备性还需递归公理化、相容性与足够算术强度等条件，不能把两个“定理标记”直接作逻辑等价</li>\n<li>停机集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>不可判定 ↔ 停机问题不可解</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K \\equiv_m K_G\">\\(K \\equiv_m K_G\\)</span>连接两个结果</li>\n<li>这是递归论视角的不完备性</li>\n<li>两种不可判定性具有同一多一度；不完备性定理还包含关于理论强度与独立句的结构结论，不能缩写成“就是停机问题”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"02b34261c2cb199c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-halting-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"8665bbc504ca9fb6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-k-g-equivalent","status":"resolved","id":"afb86879a743e8fe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ (halting set, see [[92-df-halting-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_G$ (Gödel theorem-code set, see [[92-df-godel-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K\\equiv_m K_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}halting}\\vdash\nK\\equiv_m K_G\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K \\equiv_m K_G","display":false}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["02b34261c2cb199c","8665bbc504ca9fb6","afb86879a743e8fe","06a154edf19ea063","d8d33d47202e6d60","b090f61b9f3ec664"]}